Third-Party and Vendored Code
================================================================================

This package is a Rust port of material_3_expressive and includes source code
vendored or ported from other projects. Vendored code is marked in module headers
(e.g., "Ported from", "Vendored from") with upstream attribution, version, and
license. The notices below preserve the original copyrights and license terms.

The package's declared license is `Apache-2.0 AND OFL-1.1` (see Cargo.toml):
the crate bundles Apache-2.0-only ported code (material-color-utilities,
androidx.graphics.shapes lineage, Material Icons path data) and OFL-1.1 font
data alongside its own workspace-licensed sources, so no MIT-only arm can be
offered for the combined artifact. There is no workspace-root LICENSE file;
the license texts live at `plugins/material/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt`,
`plugins/material/fonts/roboto-flex/OFL.txt`, and
`plugins/material/fonts/roboto-mono/OFL.txt`.

Unless a different license is stated in a subsection below, vendored MIT
components use the same MIT License terms as the workspace.

