  Compose lineage; this attribution activates when the ported rework lands.
- Material Icons path data (src/icons.rs): Apache-2.0, vendored verbatim from
  Google's `material-design-icons` (`google/material-design-icons`), path
  data as SVG `d` attributes in a 24x24 design box.

